-- Hotfix (WO-E209): `now` takes zero arguments
-- (docs/plan/oop-vm/08-builtin-surface.md's `now()` row) -- this
-- exercises the wrong-arity half of the same diagnostic, caught at
-- typecheck time. Arity mismatches were already caught later, at
-- emission (`WO-E403`, `emit.ml`) -- that check stays as-is; this is an
-- earlier, additional gate over the same contract, not a replacement.
fn main() {
  now(1)
}
